      "content": "i get what you're saying about the studies, but if it's so secure, why are so many people still so suspicious of it? it feels like there's a huge gap between what the experts say and what actual voters are seeing on the ground. are those concerns just coming from people trying to stir up trouble, or is there something real there that's being ignored? turn the it around for me,, if you had to pick one side,",
